sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant Browser as Next.js Client<br/>(Browser)
    participant Next as Next.js Auth Callback<br/>(Server Route)
    participant Google as Google OAuth
    participant Supabase as Supabase<br/>(Auth / Postgres)

    Note over User,Browser: Trigger: User chooses Google sign-in
    User->>Browser: Select Sign in with Google
    Browser->>Supabase: Start signInWithOAuth(provider: google)
    Supabase-->>Browser: Redirect to Google
    Browser->>Google: Authenticate and grant access
    Google-->>Supabase: Return OAuth authorization
    Supabase-->>Browser: Redirect to /auth/callback with code
    Browser->>Next: GET /auth/callback?code=...
    Next->>Supabase: Exchange code for session
    Supabase-->>Next: Authenticated session
    Next-->>Browser: Set session cookies and redirect to /
    Browser->>Supabase: Read authenticated session
    Supabase-->>Browser: Return signed-in user
